    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107963" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερφωνέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>speak exceedingly well,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				1
			</span></i>
			<u>Prooem.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans., <i>outbawl,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰμωγὴ ὑ. τὸν τῶν σαλπίγγων ἦχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					11.4.2
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>outdo,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.182a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ Θηβῶν πάθος ὑ. τοὺς Ἕλληνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Him.
					<u>Ecl.</u>
					2.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sing loudly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴνεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ju.</u>
					15.14
				</span></i>
			(<i><span class="en">
				16.1
			</span></i>).</div>
